[en.IDEA_ALL_IDEOLOGY_HIVE]
Hive Mind

[en.IDEA_ALL_IDEOLOGY_HIVE_desc]
A powerful central host individual controls all individuals, and individual self-consciousness is suppressed and completely subject to the central host individual’s scheduling. The entire country operates around the central host like a machine.

[zh.IDEA_ALL_IDEOLOGY_HIVE]
蜂巢思维

[zh.IDEA_ALL_IDEOLOGY_HIVE_desc]
一个强大的中央主机个体控制着所有的个体，个体的自我意识被压制而完全服从于中央主机个体的调度，整个国家像一部机器一样，围绕着中枢的主机运转。
